## 4. Key Takeaway

> "Different Logs. Different Perspectives. A Clearer Picture."

Each log provides a different perspective on system, application, network, cloud, and user activity.

Correlating multiple log sources helps SOC analysts build a complete picture of an incident and identify potential security threats.

**Remember:**

More Logs = Greater Visibility.

Greater Visibility = Better Detection and Investigation.

